Phase 3 — Failure Post-Mortem Template
Purpose

Failure is not shame. Failure is not scandal.
Failure is data.

This document exists to capture what actually happened, without spin, ego, or politics — so the organization learns instead of repeating the same mistake with a different paint job.

If this document becomes marketing, the program learned nothing.

1️⃣ Failure Summary (Blunt, No Spin)

Was Phase 3 execution successful?
☐ Yes
☐ No (this document required)

Plain-English Failure Statement

One paragraph. No excuses. No “context.” No softening.
Example style: “Execution failed because X didn’t work / Y collapsed / Z proved false.”

